{
  "summary": "HB 2067 amends Texas Insurance Code Chapter 551 provisions on declination, cancellation, and nonrenewal of insurance policies. It authorizes commissioner notice rules, makes insurer written reason statements mandatory without request language, adds a written declination notice requirement for liability and commercial property insurance applications, and takes effect September 1, 2025.",
